5ce743385fcf6a492e39478189f28","github_link":"https://github.com/MatterHackers/agg-sharp/commit/606055552535ce743385fcf6a492e39478189f28","commit_subject":"The WYSIWYG markdown editor takes the mouse: a click places the caret (on the right side of a word-broken wrap), a drag extends the selection across blocks and keeps scrolling on a timer while held past the view's edge, shift-click extends from the anchor (onto a Raw block too), a double click selects a word (in code too) and a triple click the block's or table cell's text, and a drag after either grows by whole words or blocks keeping the first one selected. A click between blocks or under the document goes to the nearest block. A Raw block is selected whole by a click; a double click raises RawBlockActivated with where its source starts in the written markdown (RichMarkdownWriter.SourceOffsetOf), for the Markdown tab to jump to. Cmd/Ctrl+click on a link - in a Raw block's rendering too - raises LinkClicked with its url, a plain click just places the caret, and hovering a link with the modifier shows a hand; only Control is read, as every host reports Command as Control and the Windows keys can stay latched. Every mouse caret move raises SelectionChangedByUser so typing after it starts a new undo step. The handling lives in RichEditorMouse; the widget only forwards its mouse overrides.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"commonfabric/labs","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T19:09:28Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1723eaefd4699c21d3023dfa8a00b3c4f70ed86d","github_link":"https://github.com/commonfabric/labs/commit/1723eaefd4699c21d3023dfa8a00b3c4f70ed86d","commit_subject":"test(runner): what a reader of sqliteQuery's pending flag carries, and the bound on it (#8225)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"NYRDS/remixed-dungeon","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T19:09:22Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"fd8888464be7fc5f39a3d1ffb40f1e34a618ce88","github_link":"https://github.com/NYRDS/remixed-dungeon/commit/fd8888464be7fc5f39a